  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A mapping study on the area of regional trade and food security, as per the strategy for regional development cooperation in Africa, with the aim to better understand entry points and management of Regional Trade and Food Security. The study has been carried out by consultancy firm FCG through call-off to frame agreement.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">En kartl&#xE4;ggning p&#xE5; ett omr&#xE5;de in strategin f&#xF6;r regionalt Afrika, i syfte att b&#xE4;ttre f&#xF6;rst&#xE5;r ing&#xE5;ngar och hantering f&#xF6;r Regional Handel och Livsmedelsf&#xF6;rs&#xF6;rjning. Uppdraget har utf&#xF6;rts av FCG genom avrop fr&#xE5;n ramavtal.</narrative>
  </description>
